<LinkPage kind="reset" heading="Choose a new password" copyLabel="Copy link" where="email" last="=" note="This link works once and expires in 1 hour. If you didn't ask to reset your password, you can ignore it. Your password stays the same until a new one is saved.">
  <Fragment slot="intro">Open this link in the Mọyì app to choose your new password.</Fragment>
  <Fragment slot="by-hand">Copy this link. Then open Mọyì, tap “I forgot my password”, then “Send the code”, and paste the link where the code goes. This link keeps working, and the 6-digit code in the newest email works there too, for 15 minutes.</Fragment>
</LinkPage>
